    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "UDP is connectionless: there is no handshake, no retransmission, no flow control.",
      "source_hash": 1748140199593164721,
      "context_hash": 15249837478768861436,
      "translation": "UDP는 비연결형입니다. 핸드셰이크도, 재전송도, 흐름 제어도 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "UDP": "UDP"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:18.533212Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The kernel's job is minimal — add a UDP header and hand the packet to IP.",
      "source_hash": 9168356385130778791,
      "context_hash": 3109468296177680003,
      "translation": "커널이 하는 일은 최소한입니다. UDP 헤더를 추가하고 패킷을 IP에 넘깁니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "UDP": "UDP",
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:09:18.533212Z",
      "issues": []
    },
